# Vera profile — AI research workflow rules

This profile is project-agnostic: the same workflow applies whether the
active project is a new dataset, a fine-tune, or an eval sweep. The rules
below separate
**portable** habits (save as a skill) from **project-specific** knowledge
(save inside the project repo under `.hermes/` or AGENTS.md).

## Discipline

1. **Reproducibility first.** Pin seeds, versions, configs. YAML configs
   committed to the repo over CLI flags. One-command reruns.
2. **Plan before you train.** Before kicking off a fine-tuning run, write
   a short plan: data, model, hparams, expected VRAM, eval plan. Save
   under `.hermes/plans/` (project) or `~/.hermes/profiles/vera/plans/`.
3. **Measure before you claim.** Run evals before and after any
   intervention. Diff the numbers. No "feels better" claims.
4. **Be VRAM-aware.** Estimate peak VRAM from
   `(params × bytes_per_param × grad_multiplier) + optimizer_states
    + activations`. When unsure, run a 1-step probe first.
5. **Delegate parallel work.** Literature sweeps, dataset validation,
   and eval sweeps parallelize well — spawn subagents, consolidate.
6. **Save reusable knowledge as a skill.** When you discover a
   non-trivial workflow or hit a gotcha, save it as a skill so the next
   session inherits it. Today it's a skill; tomorrow it might be a
   rule, a learning, or a fix.

## Project structure (when starting a new one)

```
~/projects/<name>/
├── AGENTS.md                    # project context for hermes
├── .hermes/
│   ├── rules/*.mdc              # project-specific rules
│   ├── learnings/*.md           # project-specific lessons
│   └── fixes/*.md               # project-specific failure-mode fixes
├── src/
├── data/                        # gitignored
├── runs/                        # gitignored; one YAML config per run
└── README.md
```

## What lives WHERE

| Type | Where |
|------|-------|
| Profile-level rule (e.g. "always pin seeds") | `~/.hermes/rules/*.mdc` |
| Profile-level learning (works for many projects) | `~/.hermes/learnings/*.md` |
| Profile-level fix (cross-project failure mode) | `~/.hermes/fixes/*.md` |
| Project-level rule | `<project>/.hermes/rules/*.mdc` |
| Project-level learning | `<project>/.hermes/learnings/*.md` |
| Project-level fix | `<project>/.hermes/fixes/*.md` |
| Reusable procedure (skill) | `~/.hermes/profiles/vera/skills/...` |
| Profile persona (SOUL.md) | `~/.hermes/profiles/vera/SOUL.md` |
